{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-08-09 09:30:00', 'title': 'BETMGM BECOMES AN OFFICIAL SPORTSBOOK PARTNER OF THE NATIONAL FOOTBALL LEAGUE IN CANADA', 'text': "PARTNERSHIP SETS STAGE FOR FUTURE ACTIVATIONS IN CANADA JERSEY CITY, N.J. , AUG. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BETMGM, A LEADING SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING OPERATOR, ANNOUNCED TODAY A MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP EXTENSION WITH THE NATIONAL FOOTBALL LEAGUE (NFL), BECOMING ONE OF THE LEAGUE'S OFFICIAL SPORTSBOOK PARTNERS IN CANADA."}